 "notes": [
  "The state and district figures come from the Chief Electoral Officer's press note of 31 July 2026 and its district statement, read from the images of those documents the office posted on X. The notices figure is from ETV Bharat on 24 September 2026.",
  "The district statement gives the roll before, the names left off and the draft by sex for all 28 districts, and every row and column adds up to the printed total.",
  "The three reasons were published only in lakh, as 15.22 lakh dead, 22.30 lakh shifted, absent or other and 7.37 lakh enrolled at more than one place. They add to 44.89 lakh, which agrees with the 44,89,512 names left off at that rounding.",
  "The roll before is the roll the statement calls pre-SIR. The press note counts it as on 24 July 2026, the last day of enumeration, and gives no date for the roll itself.",
  "The draft does not appear to include the 64,502 service electors, which the statement lists separately. The roll before less the names left off equals the draft without them.",
  "The notices figure is an interim press count of 44,28,444. The same report gives 44,00,225 verified and 28,619 pending, which add to 400 more, and 1,53,600 found ineligible so far.",
  "The final roll was due on 3 October 2026 and was moved by the Election Commission to 16 October 2026."
 ],
 "cannot_show": [
  "The reasons as exact counts, or by district or by sex. The Chief Electoral Officer published them for the state only, in lakh.",
  "The names left off in each constituency. No constituency table was found.",
  "The final roll and the names added and removed after the draft, which had not been published when these figures were collected."
 ]
